%% Order verification
flowchart TD
    PS[Payment SUCCEEDED] --> PO[adapter.place_order with payment_reference]
    PO -->|exception| UNC[PAYMENT_SUCCESS_ORDER_UNCONFIRMED]
    PO -->|ok| V[Verify: total matches, items present, external id]
    V -->|issues| UNC
    V -->|clean| CONF[CONFIRMED]
    UNC --> REC[RECOVERY / reconciliation]
    CONF --> DONE[COMPLETED]
    REC --> DONE
